  triage:title "HerdrQueueWakePump::with_clock is unconditionally pub although the sprint doc calls it test-only" ;
  triage:description "AX.5 QA-1 (quality-mgr ax5-qa-r1, PR #1201 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T12:38Z) at head da823baaa0018933f8daac388733c51eb14e9335. ruthless-boundary-qa RBQA-F001: HerdrQueueWakePump::with_clock (crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake.rs:100) is unconditionally pub on a type re-exported at the crate root (crates/atm-http-runtime/src/lib.rs:97) even though the sprint doc's own D2/C2 contract says it is test only in practice and production never calls it; zero cross-crate call sites exist and the same file already gates equivalent seams behind #[cfg(test)]. Fix: gate with_clock behind #[cfg(any(test, feature = \"test-utils\"))] (or pub(crate)) consistent with the file's other test seams." ;
